mer engagement, and creative problem-solving to deliver intuitive interfaces and innovative solutions that elevate network management and drive efficiency."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"hpe-module__aUb4oG__metricBox","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"hpe-module__aUb4oG__metricTitle","children":"Customer Engagement"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"hpe-module__aUb4oG__metricText","children":"Worked closely with varied customers ranging from small businesses to large enterprises to deliver tailored automation solutions and scripts."}]]}],"$L6"]}],"$L7","$L8"]}],"$L9"]}],["$La","$Lb"],"$Lc"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],"$Ld",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$e",["$Lf"]],"s":false,"S":true}
